{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "58f32288dc3dc760a15fd3a4d190494c1bd7c6993a54549c77d695160765c52d", "ja": "（バラエティ番組の、サバイバルゲームに参加した。\n麗花たちは謎の勢いで勝ち進み、いよいよ決勝戦だ！）", "zh": "（参加了综艺节目的生存游戏。丽花她们凭着一股神秘的气势一路过关斩将，终于要进入决赛了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "5888844a5e704f29d59a3b8ce83d071e4d5e2ecc7dc1af2bf0eac87fc3a5e6f5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n今日は、とってもいい爆発日和ですね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n今天真是非常适合爆炸的好天气呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fc2253c9d354e32f57e29dc4c079a7b7291ad8b815118525d08bd72eaa085649", "ja": "ああ、そう……だな……？\nけど麗花、大丈夫なのか？　けっこう凄い爆発だけど。", "zh": "啊，是……这样……吧……？\n不过丽花，你没问题吗？这爆炸可相当不得了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "195712cc75e315ef15a86e0307564b4c8ecce6f2780fc2eced77561fb71ecbca", "ja": "え？　準備ならばっちりですよ！\n肺活量も絶好調でーす、ららら～♪", "zh": "咦？准备工作当然万无一失啦！\n肺活量也是巅峰状态～啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2cf749eafdb2f0ef1980eb69b7878dd99ef2b344eff800f774b24c787889ba03", "ja": "うん、いい声だな……って、そうじゃなくて。\n怖かったりしないか？", "zh": "嗯，声音真不错……不对，我不是说这个。\n你不会害怕吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "7c095276a8a51c2566e3ab5be65444ee36fc7901349571c3283b907e13d9d567", "ja": "ぜんぜん、怖くなんてないですよ。　\n花火みたいに賑やかで、とっても楽しいですから♪", "zh": "一点也不害怕哦。\n像烟花一样热闹，而且特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "940c6491f30c71f02ba44a73f7f7610c7ba0debdfbe4569c5d8506e91f6f60ea", "ja": "最終ステージって、火薬の量が2倍なんですよ。\nわーい、楽しみだな～♪", "zh": "最终阶段的火药量是2倍呢。\n哇，好期待哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c8d211f08543609fa4d2392425463f5b699fb4b6cb76c9db068b24a89c63fb18", "ja": "いや、うーん……ちょっと心配だな。\nもちろん、ケガはしないようになってるみたいだけど。", "zh": "不，唔……还是有点让人担心啊。\n虽然确实好像做好了不会受伤的防护措施就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d90d129993353a751915618ab08f52f18b290b73b941997d7d27e5b8fbc31d6", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、{$P$}さん！\n爆発なんて、へっちゃらです♪", "zh": "没事的，{$P$}先生！\n区区爆炸，我才不在乎呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "542d78d9a573e4c327a5e9abd1f039607ee20b30af83e20cbd42b3c4c54ef424", "ja": "むしろ私、爆発と一緒に、どっかーんって空を飛んで、\n爆発系アイドルになりたいぐらいなんですから♪", "zh": "我反而还想和爆炸一起“砰——”地飞上天，\n成为爆炸系偶像呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0bec96292d53e9ef637b30637dca7d63a2b74d655d7cd504f90d5e63cbd6b850", "ja": "い、いや、巻き込まれないでくれよ！\nやっぱり今からでも、監督さんに言って……。", "zh": "不、不是，别被卷进去啊！\n要不还是现在去跟导演说说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "ead8c7d7b83f3a135bd42c69558edc8a4960d88348492ed8c622140ba9836d44", "ja": "大丈夫ですって！　もう撮影始まっちゃいますし。\nもっと私を信じてください、ね？", "zh": "没事的啦！而且拍摄马上就要开始了。\n请多相信我一点，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "659a8476f467213e6d0d50d4ff69f0cab822274ef772f60df61fdf962df5a33e", "ja": "ではでは、コマンデューサーさん。\nミッション開始の指令をお願いします♪", "zh": "那么，指挥制作人先生。请下达开始任务的指令吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0b26a2d6a30a708862d5f240a3f1db9307e1d6fc75cc1e035cbf51788f78689b", "ja": "ええと……それは、俺の事なのか？", "zh": "呃……那是在说我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "a4d348c007dac697526600125a538412bbcb11a0e3782bd6c8907c5589fafc2c", "ja": "そうです！　今日の{$P$}さんは、\n私の上官さん、ってことですよ♪", "zh": "没错！今天的{$P$}先生，就是我的长官哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "adfbb0bc8a605b97607d4505949e56aac353f92723fa7c57089080c6dde3e545", "ja": "歌えて踊れちゃう、麗花軍曹でーす！\nさあ命令してください、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "我是会唱歌又会跳舞的丽花中士——！来，请下达命令吧，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7b804e1106ec90581a05eb7c306c306a56d8ae21ea842fa0b5cd27c1953648cb", "ja": "そうか……よし、わかった。じゃあ……。", "zh": "这样啊……好，我明白了。那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_1017", "source_sha256": "1371e5cbb39bcb00595dd7f2a9a73ed84156ab262baa4c49d600ff41d1a18cae", "ja": "突撃！", "zh": "突击！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_2000_p", "source_sha256": "379cac1877cb2c65d2a0228c9939ab8fd11a70bb1e17f49144b444ba007bc005", "ja": "麗花軍曹に、上官として命令する！\n無事に帰って、我が軍に勝利をもたらしてくれ！", "zh": "现在以长官的身份向丽花军曹下令！平安归来，为我军带来胜利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_2001_048rei", "source_sha256": "2d7ec2018c57ea31623ec5b212b4ef44ae69f3ab175b6b735c6a4678302ac7e2", "ja": "ラジャーですっ♪\n行ってきますね、コマンデューサーさん！", "zh": "收到♪\n我出发啦，指挥制作人先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_2002_048rei", "source_sha256": "58ce8c6cba3bfbe6536aa52e67ba04e6c8f22c5081328f3a771ae33ab849a429", "ja": "さぁ、茜ちゃん、琴葉ちゃん！　みんなを笑顔にして、\nハッピー勲章をもらっちゃいましょう。", "zh": "来吧，小茜、琴叶！让大家露出笑容，拿到幸福勋章吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_2003_048rei", "source_sha256": "4d0bd0c4ecce5c4b9ac5ec4e02832fa40604c06471061e02885d49dd1604d964", "ja": "和三盆小隊、とっつげきー！\nぱんぱかぱ～ん♪", "zh": "和三盆小队，突击——！\n叭叭叭叭～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0204_2004_p", "source_sha256": "88a7a2c39994c01da408030027b872f1c9efb5e02344890f24e01e44a71bd904", "ja": "（担当アイドルを信じろ、か……そうだな。\nしっかり見守りながら、信じよう。麗花達の勝利を！）", "zh": "（相信负责的偶像吗……说得对。要一边好好守望着她们，一边相信她们。为了丽花她们的胜利！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
